    {
        "text": "The bloody tide stops in its tracks."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was as though they ran into an invisible wall when they rounded the corner. The maggot-shaped Arts creations smash themselves into pieces, leaving bloody trails on the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "The empty street is completely silent."
    },
