    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_660_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A dozen big, bruising workers surround you."
    },
    {
        "text": "Their eyes are filled with suspicion."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You glance at the drills and spanners in their hands, then at Feist, dressed like the workers, but here on his own."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Seems like it was more than a little fight.;Are you sure they're not hostiles?",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess Granny is still sore at me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got no reason to be sore at a dead man. I didn't even know my only grandson was still alive, 'til a minute ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wanted to send a message, but it was too risky. The Sarkaz monitor all communications into Highbury.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't let the Sarkaz tie you to the Self-Salvation Corps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you joined that band of crackpots.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Londinium Citizens' Self-Salvation Corps.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We did a lot in Sudean, Granny. The Sarkaz control the media, and they call us an 'unnamed violent gang'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the ones who blew up the wall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... it was the Do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The Sarkaz damaged the walls while pursuing the Corps.;Your grandson fought bravely in the battle.",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right... it was mostly the Sarkaz who did it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't know you had such high regard for my rope work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you're here to blow up the armory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say to your Self-Salvation Corps friends? We're making weapons for the Sarkaz, to use against Victorians?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Granny. What I told them was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My granny stands up to protect their livelihoods.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you think I'm a brat with little more than a couple of silly tricks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I didn't come back to drag the workers into this. And I'm not here to try to convince you, either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have my goals, of course, and it'd be brilliant if you were able to help me. But first\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just wanted to see that you're safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_648_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come here, and let me have a look at you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catherine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
