    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll have the goods soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "A suit of steam armor... how many men would kill to get one like it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The nobles of Leithanien love to flaunt such storied antiques.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and do be sure to ask those Columbian firms as well. They might be interested, even if the tech is centuries old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Getting it out will be no trouble at all. What business do you think I'm running in Londinium these days?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz are a gang of raving psychopaths, and they alone can't rule Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have friends in the Defense Forces. They'll take care of it for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've heard it has a few external blemishes, however. I do hope that won't hurt the price?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not cancel the deal, if you're so worried about the price?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, we just happened to be traveling the same way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get this intruder out of here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Say... where are my bodyguards?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've asked them to take a short nap. You can go and wake them once we've finished our chat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of them...? Against just one of you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One? Oh, my, no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look behind you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... this is Londinium! I've got friends in high places!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_unsheathe",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Where are they? Do tell, I bet I'd get on famously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eek! D-Don't do anything rash, now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Play nice with us and nobody has to get beat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever Siege says, you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise, my claws won't be aimed at the wall next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_iron_claw",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "A-Alright! I understand!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Seriously?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really got into it there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I learned it from you lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now then, let him go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_177"
    },
    {
        "text": "*whimper*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can open your eyes and put your hands down now, Mr. Bader. We're not going to hurt you... at least not yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My terms are clear. Cancel the deal for the Cumberland steam armor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you'll let me go if I agree?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'll make sure you keep your side of the bargain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Show Mr. Bader our map, Morgan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "With pleasure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_scroll",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The marks on the map... those are my warehouses! How do you know about them?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't pay much attention when you're out and about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You shadowed me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct. The Sarkaz cannot be bribed. If they learn that you've smuggled so much contraband into Londinium through your 'connections'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How helpful do you think your friend will be? Will he be in any position to protect you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're considering tipping off the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "That may well get us all killed, but they won't have to know anything if you continue to work with us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I have a choice?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand your circumstances, and I appreciate the opportunity to work with you. You will be compensated fairly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait a second...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is your relationship to Allerdale Cumberland? Are you her attendant? I can't imagine House Cumberland is in any position to hire one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch your mouth! The Cumberland serves Vina, not the other way 'round!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's the daughter of a duke! You don't mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Londinium Merchant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. I'm nobody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Cumberland and I are comrades, along with thousands upon thousands of Londiniers who long for peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do hope you're one of them, Mr. Bader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
